  "details": "   * SECURITY REGRESSION: worker crash on an HTTP/2 HEADERS frame that\n     depends on its own stream id after the CVE-2023-44487 fix\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2023-44487-2.patch: close the connection with\n       PROTOCOL_ERROR on a HEADERS or PRIORITY frame with self-dependency\n       instead of jumping to the RST_STREAM path before the server\n       configuration pointer is set, so the refused streams check added\n       by CVE-2023-44487 no longer reads an uninitialized pointer\n     - CVE-2023-44487",
